    "%@。新增的数据类型（血压、血氧、呼吸频率、体温）需要重新请求才能读取。已经做过选择的项 iOS 不会再问，要打开或关闭请到“健康”App > 共享 > App > Vana。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. Newly added data types (blood pressure, blood oxygen, respiratory rate, body temperature) need a fresh request before they can be read. iOS never asks again about types you've already decided on — to turn them on or off, go to the Health app > Sharing > Apps > Vana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@。缺少的项目多半是那几天没有戴设备。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@. Missing items usually mean the device wasn't worn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@体检要重点查什么" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What should a %@ check-up focus on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@在吃的这些一起吃有问题吗" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Is it safe for %@ to take these together"
