      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Provider ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provider 和模型都从 AIKit 内置目录里选。API key 只保存在本机钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Provider and model are picked from AIKit's built-in catalog. Your API key is stored only in this device's keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serper key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Serper key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana 不是医疗器械，也不是医生。它给出的分析基于你的健康数据和一个通用语言模型，仅供参考，不构成医疗诊断、治疗方案或用药建议，也不会给出任何剂量建议，不能替代医生、药师或其他专业医疗人员的判断。\n\n模型会出错——它可能读错化验单上的一个小数点，也可能把一段过去的数据当成最近的。据此做出的任何健康决定，请先和专业人员确认。\n\n身体出现急症（例如胸痛、呼吸困难、意识改变、严重出血），或者有伤害自己的念头时，请立即就医或拨打当地急救电话，不要等 Vana 回答。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vana is not a medical device and not a doctor. Its analysis is based on your health data and a general-purpose language model. It is for reference only: it is not a diagnosis, treatment plan or medication advice, it never gives doses, and it cannot replace the judgment of a doctor, pharmacist or other health professional.\n\nModels make mistakes — one may misread a decimal point on a lab report, or treat old data as recent. Please confirm any health decision with a professional first.\n\nIf you have an emergency (chest pain, trouble breathing, altered consciousness, severe bleeding) or thoughts of harming yourself, get medical help or call your local emergency number immediately — don't wait for Vana to answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana 自己没有服务器" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vana has no server of its own"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana 要靠一个模型来回答你的问题，而那个模型跑在你自己选的那家服务上。所以有些东西必须发出去，有些不用——这一屏说清是哪些。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vana needs a model to answer your questions, and that model runs on the service you choose. So some things have to be sent and some don't — this screen spells out which."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana 记住的事" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What Vana remembers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vana 还没看到" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vana hasn't seen this yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一句话说清就行。不要写具体数字——步数、睡眠时长这些每次都会重新查，写死在这里明天就是错的。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One sentence is enough. Don't write specific numbers — steps, sleep and the like are read fresh every time, and a number pinned here is wrong tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般说明" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "General description"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上周整体怎么样？" : {
      "localizations" : {
