    "只写称呼就行。Vana 不需要真实姓名、生日或证件信息，也不要填进来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A nickname is enough. Vana doesn't need a real name, birthday or ID details — please don't enter them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只列出支持工具调用的模型——不支持的模型读不到健康数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only models that support tool calls are listed — models without it can't read health data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删这条记录，不影响「健康」App 里的任何数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes this entry only. Nothing in the Health app changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只到城市这一级，模型看到的就是上面这一行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "City level only — the line above is exactly what the model sees."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只发文字" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Text only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只改语气和详略，不改数据口径——同样只引用工具返回的数字，同样不做诊断。\n思考让多步分析更准，但更慢也更贵；有些模型不支持关闭，那就还是会思考。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changes tone and level of detail only, never how data is read — still only numbers the tools return, still no diagnosis.\nThinking makes multi-step analysis more accurate but slower and more expensive; some models can't turn it off, so they think anyway."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有你记下的内容" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "only what you've written down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有本机一个字都没认出来的照片才问你一句，你点了才发。化验单、药盒这些认得出字的连问都不会问——它们的文字已经够回答问题了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're only asked about photos where this device recognized no text at all, and nothing is sent until you tap. Lab reports and medicine boxes are never asked about — their text already answers the question."
          }
        }
      }
    },
