      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Balanced"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填了 serper.dev 的 key，Vana 遇到自己不知道的事就能上网查一下，并给出出处。不填就只用它已有的知识回答。搜索词不会带上你的健康数据。key 只保存在本机钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With a serper.dev key, Vana can look up things it doesn't know and cite the source. Without one it answers from what it already knows. Search terms never include your health data. The key is stored only in this device's keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写 API key 之后才能开始提问" : {
