            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start speaking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时，Vana 会在对话结束后记下你的长期情况和表达偏好，并在之后的提问里带上。关掉只是先不用，已经记下的还在下面，要删有单独的按钮。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, Vana notes your longer-term situation and preferences after a conversation and brings them along next time. Turning it off just pauses it — what's already saved stays below, and there's a separate button to delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时，这份清单会随每次提问一起发给你选的模型 provider，Vana 给建议之前会先看你不能吃什么、试过什么没用。关掉只是先不用，下面的内容还在。" : {
