    "此设备不支持健康数据" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device doesn't support health data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步数、睡眠、心率这些数字来自 %@。Vana 只读取你授权的项目，不会写入或修改你的健康记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steps, sleep and heart rate come from %@. Vana only reads what you authorize and never writes to or modifies your health records."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步行徒步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Walking & hiking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每位成员的会话、用药清单、记忆和照片各存一份，互相看不到。\nApple 健康数据只有本人有：家人这边读不到步数、睡眠、心率这些，他的情况来自你记下的用药、拍给 Vana 的化验单，和你们聊过的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each member's conversations, medication list, memories and photos are stored separately and can't see each other.\nApple Health data belongs to the device owner only: for a family member, steps, sleep and heart rate aren't available — what Vana knows comes from the medications you record, the reports you photograph, and what you've talked about."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天或按疗程在吃的。它会成为解读你健康数据时的前提。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taken daily or as a course. It becomes context for reading your health data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每张照片的原图都会发到你配置的模型服务上，包括化验单——那上面有姓名、就诊号、医院和医生签名，而回答问题通常只需要那几行数值。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every original photo goes to the model service you configured, lab reports included — those carry a name, record number, hospital and doctor's signature, while answering usually only needs a few lines of numbers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每张都发原图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
