    "照片原图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Original photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片原图——默认不发；本机认不出文字的那些会问你一句，你点了才发" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Original photos — not sent by default; you're asked about the ones with no recognized text, and nothing goes until you tap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片和文件原件——识别在本机做，发出去的默认只有文字；原图发不发在设置里定，每一张发送前还能单独改" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo and file originals — recognized on this device, and by default only the text is sent; whether originals go is set in Settings, and each one can still be changed before sending"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片在本机识别成文字，文件直接取文字；原图默认不发，发送之前每一张都能单独决定" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photos are read into text on this device and files are read directly; originals aren't sent by default, and you decide photo by photo before sending"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片永远不出这台手机。认不出字的那些（一顿饭、一处皮疹）Vana 就答不上来，需要的话在那张图的核对面板里单独打开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photos never leave this phone. Vana can't answer about the ones with no text (a meal, a rash) — turn a single image on in its review panel if you need to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "照片里的文字一律在本机识别，发出去的默认只有文字。这一项管的只是原图要不要跟着走，而且只是默认——发送之前点开任意一张，都能单独决定这一张发不发。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Text in photos is always recognized on this device, and by default only that text is sent. This setting only decides whether originals go along, and it's only a default — open any photo before sending to decide for that one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
