    },
    "系统没有把授权面板推上来。已经做过选择的数据类型 iOS 不会再问——要打开或关闭，请到“健康”App > 共享 > App > Vana。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS didn't bring up the permission sheet. It never asks again about data types you've already decided on — to turn them on or off, go to the Health app > Sharing > Apps > Vana."
