    },
    "结束说话" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop speaking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给了之后 Vana 每次回答都知道你大概在哪个城市，季节气候、时差、当地饮食和就医方式才答得准。只取到城市，不取街道地址，也不会保存在本机；不给就完全不带位置，其余功能照常。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With this, Vana knows roughly which city you're in, so answers about season, climate, time zone, local food and care are accurate. Only the city is used, never a street address, and it isn't stored on this device. Without it, no location is included and everything else works as usual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给出下一步该做什么" : {
